00:03:33.689 --> 00:03:35.739
So those are all really great ideas.

00:03:35.739 --> 00:03:39.319
So here's what we're doing in the immediate
number one, we are going to start making some

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:43.920
tweaks with regard to interview and story
length that are reflective of what people

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:44.920
